{"surah":95,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"95:1","arabic":"وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيۡتُونِ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"By the fig and the olive","id":"Demi (buah) Tin dan (buah) Zaitun,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلتِّينِ","en":"By the fig","id":"By the fig"},{"a":"وَٱلزَّيۡتُونِ","en":"and the olive","id":"and the olive"}]},{"n":2,"key":"95:2","arabic":"وَطُورِ سِينِينَ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] Mount Sinai","id":"demi gunung Sinai,","words":[{"a":"وَطُورِ","en":"And (the) Mount","id":"And (the) Mount"},{"a":"سِينِينَ","en":"Sinai","id":"Sinai"}]},{"n":3,"key":"95:3","arabic":"وَهَٰذَا ٱلۡبَلَدِ ٱلۡأَمِينِ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] this secure city [i.e., Makkah],","id":"dan demi negeri (Mekkah) yang aman ini.","words":[{"a":"وَهَٰذَا","en":"And this","id":"And this"},{"a":"ٱلۡبَلَدِ","en":"[the] city","id":"[the] city"},{"a":"ٱلۡأَمِينِ","en":"[the] secure","id":"[the] secure"}]},{"n":4,"key":"95:4","arabic":"لَقَدۡ خَلَقۡنَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ فِيٓ أَحۡسَنِ تَقۡوِيمٖ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature;","id":"Sungguh, Kami telah menciptakan manusia dalam bentuk yang sebaik-baiknya,","words":[{"a":"لَقَدۡ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed"},{"a":"خَلَقۡنَا","en":"We created","id":"We created"},{"a":"ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","en":"man","id":"man"},{"a":"فِيٓ","en":"in","id":"in"},{"a":"أَحۡسَنِ","en":"(the) best","id":"(the) best"},{"a":"تَقۡوِيمٖ","en":"mould","id":"mould"}]},{"n":5,"key":"95:5","arabic":"ثُمَّ رَدَدۡنَٰهُ أَسۡفَلَ سَٰفِلِينَ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"Then We return him to the lowest of the low,","id":"kemudian Kami kembalikan dia ke tempat yang serendah-rendahnya,","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then"},{"a":"رَدَدۡنَٰهُ","en":"We returned him","id":"We returned him"},{"a":"أَسۡفَلَ","en":"(to the) lowest","id":"(to the) lowest"},{"a":"سَٰفِلِينَ","en":"(of the) low","id":"(of the) low"}]},{"n":6,"key":"95:6","arabic":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ فَلَهُمۡ أَجۡرٌ غَيۡرُ مَمۡنُونٖ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted.","id":"kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan; maka mereka akan mendapat pahala yang tidak ada putus-putusnya.","words":[{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"Except","id":"Except"},{"a":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","id":"those who"},{"a":"ءَامَنُواْ","en":"believe","id":"believe"},{"a":"وَعَمِلُواْ","en":"and do","id":"and do"},{"a":"ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","en":"righteous deeds","id":"righteous deeds"},{"a":"فَلَهُمۡ","en":"then for them","id":"then for them"},{"a":"أَجۡرٌ","en":"(is a) reward","id":"(is a) reward"},{"a":"غَيۡرُ","en":"never","id":"never"},{"a":"مَمۡنُونٖ","en":"ending","id":"ending"}]},{"n":7,"key":"95:7","arabic":"فَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعۡدُ بِٱلدِّينِ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"So what yet causes you to deny the Recompense?","id":"Maka apa yang menyebabkan (mereka) mendustakanmu (tentang) hari pembalasan setelah (adanya keterangan-keterangan) itu?","words":[{"a":"فَمَا","en":"Then what","id":"Then what"},{"a":"يُكَذِّبُكَ","en":"causes you to deny","id":"causes you to deny"},{"a":"بَعۡدُ","en":"after (this)","id":"after (this)"},{"a":"بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"the judgment","id":"the judgment"}]},{"n":8,"key":"95:8","arabic":"أَلَيۡسَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَحۡكَمِ ٱلۡحَٰكِمِينَ","page":597,"juz":30,"en":"Is not Allāh the most just of judges?","id":"Bukankah Allah Hakim yang paling adil?","words":[{"a":"أَلَيۡسَ","en":"Is not","id":"Is not"},{"a":"ٱللَّهُ","en":"Allah","id":"Allah"},{"a":"بِأَحۡكَمِ","en":"(the) Most Just","id":"(the) Most Just"},{"a":"ٱلۡحَٰكِمِينَ","en":"(of) the Judges","id":"(of) the Judges"}]}]}